| **B – aggressive PD, no swing‑up** | ‑1340.3 | The controller kept applying the maximum negative torque (‑8 N·m) for the whole episode.  The pendulum simply swung clockwise at full speed, never reaching the upright region – the reward is dominated by the huge `θ²` term. |
