### 2. Updated rule set (the new “best‑ever” strategy)

Below is a compact, self‑contained pseudocode that can be copied directly into a reinforcement‑learning baseline (e.g. OpenAI‑Gym `Pendulum-v1`).  It uses only the three observation values (`x`, `y`, `θ̇`) and the same torque limits (`‑2 … +2`).  

