## 4️⃣  Quick sanity‑check on the last 20‑step trace  

The previous trace (current strategy) shows the pendulum already at `[1.0, 0.0, …]` (θ≈0) with torque ≈ 0. That is exactly the *balanced* region we want to stay in.  

With the new rule‑set, once `|θ| < 0.25` the controller will switch to the PD block **immediately** (no extra 0.8 · (‑θ) bias). The PD torque will be about `‑10·0 ‑ 2.5·0 = 0`, so the torque will stay at 0 for the rest of the episode, giving the maximal possible reward.

