| **Rule‑set 2 (similar to 1 but with a larger bias term)** | –266.6 | A stronger bias (‑θ) should accelerate the swing‑up. | The controller overshoots the upright region and spends a lot of time with larger angles and velocities, which inflates the quadratic penalty on `θ` and `θ̇`. The extra bias actually hurts more than it helps. |
