| **Bias / “push‑toward‑zero” term** | Add a small linear bias that always pushes the torque in the direction of –θ: <br> bias = ‑0.4·θ | Reinforces the PD action when the pole is slightly off‑center, but is tiny enough not to dominate the PD term. |
